@startuml autonomous-product-value-stream-boundary
title Autonomous Product / Autonomous Value Stream Boundary ; per ADR-ES-017 §11

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Autonomous Value Stream" as AVS
class "Stakeholder Value" as SV
class "Autonomous Product" as AP

AVS --> SV : realizes
AVS --> AP : may involve

note right
  Per ADR-ES-017 §11 + APROD-AUTO-NEG-005 + APROD-AUTO-NEG-014:
  - Autonomous Product is NOT Autonomous Value Stream
  - Autonomous Value Stream is NOT Autonomous Product
  - A conventional Product may participate in an Autonomous Value Stream
end note

@enduml
